Kです\n①:中出しされてイってる\n②:①の後で指揮官に優しく微笑んでいる\n\n以上になります。ご検討いただければ幸いです。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/azurlane_staff/status/1171657906615459842", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shinshin_ki/works/90", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 550164, "client_id": 533957, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e2edd08/uploads/origins/55a6d7bb-caad-4fec-bd0d-1e7a129337a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04f79f77941d053ae6571139c622fe80", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e2edd08/uploads/origins/55a6d7bb-caad-4fec-bd0d-1e7a129337a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d7e76021023feda0153869530da8baed", "src_set": ""}, "body": "前回は素敵なエレナさんをありがとうございました\nよろしければまたエレナさんで依頼させてください\n\nキャラは光の守護者エレナ（水着）\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FbEuJ6pacAIVLjy?format=jpg&name=large\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FaltVL-aQAARHlG?format=jpg&name=large\n\nシチュとしては以前描かれていたフェイトさん\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/91417001\nのような感じで、人気の無い場所で精処理の為におっぱいを吸わせながら中出しまでさせてくれるといった感じでお願いします。", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shinshin_ki/works/89", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8ab8340/uploads/origins/757f6a31-b224-40de-af42-4ca376abedfc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c7bb6077c683eab5316e9d0b35bcc093", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 550164, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "n